-----BEGIN PLACEHOLDER-----
This repository does not ship real key material.

Run scripts/tls/generate_certs.sh to write a freshly generated CA, device
certificate and key into main/certs_local/ (gitignored). When that folder
exists the build embeds it instead of these placeholders (EMBED_TXTFILES in
main/CMakeLists.txt), so the firmware must be rebuilt afterwards.

They are only used by the mTLS and MQTTS baselines; the SRAFT protocol
itself does not depend on them.

Leave the placeholders in main/certs/ unchanged.
-----END PLACEHOLDER-----
